#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# These are explicitly windows files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf

# The review ledger is append-only and order-independent (its header says so),
# so two passes that each appended a line are not in conflict: keep both. This
# applies to merges and to the rebase that pull and push-one perform onto a
# moved origin, and removes the one conflict an unattended review queue
# generates on its own.
docs/skills/review-oldest-java/reviewed.txt merge=union

